.TH "DEDALUS\-LOGOUT" "1" "" "dedalus" "Dedalus Manual"
.SH "NAME"
dedalus\-logout \- forget saved credentials
.SH "SYNOPSIS"
.B dedalus logout
[\fB\-\-all\fR] [\fB\-\-base\-url\fR \fIurl\fR]
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
Removes the credentials saved for one base URL, or for every base URL. Nothing else is affected: a credential supplied through a flag or an environment variable is not stored here and keeps working.
.SH "OPTIONS"
.TP
\fB\-\-all\fR
Forget every saved credential, for every base URL.
.TP
\fB\-\-base\-url\fR \fIurl\fR
Forget the credentials saved for this base URL.
